  "bodyHash": "de721b01638a17ce",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/convenienteffects/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/convenienteffects/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/convenienteffects/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Convenient Effects 讓 Minecraft 的药水效果更順暢、更聰明，使用起來也更加滿足感——而不改變你的釀藥方式！✨</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">沒有新物品，沒有複雜系統——只是更好的效果。💡 感覺它本來就應該屬於 Minecraft！🎮</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/convenienteffects/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🎭 較不顯眼的药水粒子效果</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧍 第一人称視角變得更清晰——粒子被減少或隱藏。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⚙️ 根據設定，也可以應用於第三人稱或所有實體。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🦘 跳躍提升</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">在 2 級或以上時，可以不用跳躍走上整格高的區塊！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🏃 非常適合順暢的跑酷和探索不平坦的地形。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌫️ 失明效果</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">現在會隨著药水等級增加而增加強度。更高的等級 = 更強烈的效果。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">👁️ 也會影響怪物並減少它們探測到你的範圍——潛行時不被發現！</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🔥 火焰抗性</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🔥 離開熔岩或火焰後，不再繼續燃燒。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧯 火焰覆蓋層隱藏——再也不會有刺眼的火焰在你面前！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌋 在熔岩中游泳也能看得很清楚。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">✨ 效果結束時的平滑淡出——看起來好多了。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌙 夜視效果</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">結束時不再有惱人的閃爍。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">👀 享受清晰、平滑地切換回正常視力。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🪶 緩慢降落</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">按住潛行可暫時更快地下墜且不會受到摔落傷害。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧗 非常適合用鞘翅落地、洞穴或登山。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/convenienteffects/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/convenienteffects/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/convenienteffects/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> CLIENT 需要安裝，SERVER 也需要安裝</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/puzzles-lib\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> (FABRIC &amp; NEOFORGE)</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> (FABRIC)</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> (FABRIC)</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/convenienteffects/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">如果模組可用，可以直接透過遊戲內模組選單進行設定（需要 Fabric 上由 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 安裝）。請注意，在舊版 Minecraft 中安裝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Forge Config Screens</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 也是必需的。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">使用外部文字編輯器進行手動設定時，所有檔案都位於 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，命名為 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">或 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，取決於設定的類型。並非每個模組都存在所有類型的設定。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/convenienteffects/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/raltsmc\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Raltsmc</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 啟發了失明效果的調整，來自他們的 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mob-blindness\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mob Blindness</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 模組。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/convenienteffects/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/easy-shulker-boxes\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/sword-blocking-mechanics\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/swordblockingmechanics/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/magnum-torch\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/magnumtorch/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/convenienteffects/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/convenienteffects/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
